job.description:
The ideal candidate will have experience building native applications in both Android (Kotlin/Java) and IOS (Swift) or FLUTTER and a portfolio of applications already published either in the app store or self-hosted. Looking for someone with strong frontend design and development skill.

Qualifications:

- Have two or more iOS/Android apps developed with Flutter deployed on the AppStore/Google Play or available on Github;

- Minimum 2.5+ years in mobile software development;

- Over three year’s developing Flutter applications for mobile;

- Experience with third-party libraries and APIs;

- Understanding of the Application development life-cycle;

- Experience with Apple App-store and its nuisances

- Experience with payment gateway integration

- Experience with Work manager and offline database

- Experience with GetX and clean architecture

- Ability to recreate UI from Figma/XD

- Experience with automated testing and building;

- Experience with Git, SVN, or other version control tools;

- Proven experience in writing readable code, creating extensive documentation for existing code, and refactoring previously written code
